    "detailed_description": "Batman, The cleanup hitter of the Crusaders must challenge the Evil Demons, A baseball team summoned from the pits of hell. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn order to improve his batting for the upcomming World Series, Can he survive this hellish training?<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2605\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHit the balls back at the enemies to hurt them. A Precisely timed swing will send the ball back with more power and accuracy!<br />\r\nBunt will block all incomming balls. Time it well and it will make you go faster!<br />\r\nDodge the explosions by dashing away from danger!<br />\r\nCollect shinies dropped from enemies to gain power-ups!",
